{"4665400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bustle Beacon", "steam_appid": 4665400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladies and Gentlemen, I have a hell of a deal for you. Rent a beacon station on the Fog Lane with almost nothing down. Build. Produce. Trade. Outrun the rent — and the place is yours. The bustle shall not stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bustle Beacon is first and foremost a game about resource management, production, and trade, wrapped in a lightweight city builder. It also includes rogue-lite elements.</strong> <strong><i>Turn-based, no rush.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/59ed41b6211d7bd93d7794563bed4d52.webp?t=1787169482\" width=300 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/63a11bbfe1cad6fa9c7b869117b60287.webp?t=1787169482\" width=200 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/3a29c833ac6a20f1056961faf588e14d.webp?t=1787169482\" width=180 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bustle Beacon is a turn-based roguelite city-builder where production chains, trade, and clever logistics decide your fate. Your beacon pushes back the clinging fog — but rent day always comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Build workshops, gather resources, and attract wandering merchants and curious tourists. Every new run offers different buildings, unexpected opportunities, and shifting land layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logistics is everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you place your buildings matters. A well-organized district lets you chain production without consuming incoming resources — efficiency through smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices shape your chains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each production building can respond to its neighbors in multiple ways. Will your smelter refine ore into bars, or break it down into rare byproducts? Every interaction is a branching decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchants and tourists are your lifeline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some buildings contain arrival spots for them — taverns, warehouses, or market squares. But those spots won't fill on their own. You must construct other buildings that actively attract merchants and tourists: taverns, attractions, trading posts, or cultural sites. Attract more visitors — unlock better deals, rare resources, and bonus income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world of variety.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of resources, many buildings, and multiple paths to obtain and transform them. No two runs feel the same. Experiment, optimize, and keep the bustle alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beacon demands payment. Grow fast, trade smart, and build wisely.  Adapt, reset, and rise again.<br>The fog never sleeps. The rent never waits. Keep your Beacon bustling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/991b7985cf1c726f159baa9e6c45e954.avif?t=1787169482\" width=710 height=340 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladies and Gentlemen, I have a hell of a deal for you. Rent a beacon station on the Fog Lane with almost nothing down. Build. Produce. Trade. Outrun the rent — and the place is yours. The bustle shall not stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bustle Beacon is first and foremost a game about resource management, production, and trade, wrapped in a lightweight city builder. It also includes rogue-lite elements.</strong> <strong><i>Turn-based, no rush.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/59ed41b6211d7bd93d7794563bed4d52.webp?t=1787169482\" width=300 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/880b845992b50249134406fce0b74509.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/63a11bbfe1cad6fa9c7b869117b60287.webp?t=1787169482\" width=200 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/016dbf0dec205c07578b669de7d3b6a3.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/3a29c833ac6a20f1056961faf588e14d.webp?t=1787169482\" width=180 height=26 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.poster.avif?t=1787169482\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.webm?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/7baa5037bdff3ad5f7983e0e10929295.mp4?t=1787169482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bustle Beacon is a turn-based roguelite city-builder where production chains, trade, and clever logistics decide your fate. Your beacon pushes back the clinging fog — but rent day always comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. Build workshops, gather resources, and attract wandering merchants and curious tourists. Every new run offers different buildings, unexpected opportunities, and shifting land layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logistics is everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you place your buildings matters. A well-organized district lets you chain production without consuming incoming resources — efficiency through smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices shape your chains.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each production building can respond to its neighbors in multiple ways. Will your smelter refine ore into bars, or break it down into rare byproducts? Every interaction is a branching decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchants and tourists are your lifeline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some buildings contain arrival spots for them — taverns, warehouses, or market squares. But those spots won't fill on their own. You must construct other buildings that actively attract merchants and tourists: taverns, attractions, trading posts, or cultural sites. Attract more visitors — unlock better deals, rare resources, and bonus income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world of variety.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of resources, many buildings, and multiple paths to obtain and transform them. No two runs feel the same. Experiment, optimize, and keep the bustle alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beacon demands payment. Grow fast, trade smart, and build wisely.  Adapt, reset, and rise again.<br>The fog never sleeps. The rent never waits. Keep your Beacon bustling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/extras/991b7985cf1c726f159baa9e6c45e954.avif?t=1787169482\" width=710 height=340 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Become the Landman of a fog-light station. Expand your hearth, harvest resources from the dark forest, and build production chains based on available permits. Attract tourists and traders — trade, feed, and entertain them. Develop your settlement according to decrees. Turn a profit in your new home.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/d268514f445556f9a043057c3bce7c0953a1b5c3/header.jpg?t=1787169482", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/a6e453d2caf1965269a5b5667f2299ff96342fee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787169482", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/a6e453d2caf1965269a5b5667f2299ff96342fee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787169482", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-530 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-530 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Max Estry"], "publishers": ["Max Estry"], "demos": [{"appid": 4784300, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/bbfbba28dbc7f4020f4276b129dbed87110cc55d/ss_bbfbba28dbc7f4020f4276b129dbed87110cc55d.600x338.jpg?t=1787169482", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/bbfbba28dbc7f4020f4276b129dbed87110cc55d/ss_bbfbba28dbc7f4020f4276b129dbed87110cc55d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787169482"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665400/daab9268009d889575d861c28a8076d657c7f8e7/ss_daab9268009d889575